            "raw_output": "--- train head/tail ---\npath,timestep,present,dayofyear\ns3://nasa-surya-bench/2010/05/20100513_0012.nc,2010-05-13 00:12:00,1,133\ns3://nasa-surya-bench/2010/05/20100513_0024.nc,2010-05-13 00:24:00,1,133\n...\ns3://nasa-surya-bench/2024/12/20241230_2336.nc,2024-12-30 23:36:00,1,365\ns3://nasa-surya-bench/2024/12/20241230_2348.nc,2024-12-30 23:48:00,1,365\ns3://nasa-surya-bench/2024/12/20241231_0000.nc,2024-12-31 00:00:00,1,366\n467401 data/indices/surya_aws_s3_train.csv\n--- val head/tail ---\npath,timestep,present,dayofyear\ns3://nasa-surya-bench/2011/01/20110116_0000.nc,2011-01-16 00:00:00,1,16\ns3://nasa-surya-bench/2011/01/20110116_0012.nc,2011-01-16 00:12:00,1,16\n...\ns3://nasa-surya-bench/2024/01/20240130_2324.nc,2024-01-30 23:24:00,1,30\ns3://nasa-surya-bench/2024/01/20240130_2336.nc,2024-01-30 23:36:00,1,30\ns3://nasa-surya-bench/2024/01/20240130_2348.nc,2024-01-30 23:48:00,1,30\n21601 data/indices/surya_aws_s3_val.csv\n--- flare index ---\nID,goes_id,start_time,peak_t,stop_t,class,noaa_ar,location,lon,link,peak_flux_wm2,intensity_rank\n18,gev_20130408_1756,2013-04-08T18:00:00.000,18:00:00,18:00:00,B9.9,1713,N08W59  ( 1713 ),59,http://www.lmsal.com/solarsoft/latest_events_archive/events_summary/2013/04/08/gev_20130408_1756/index.html,9.9e-07,40\n27,gev_20130501_0120,2013-05-01T01:24:00.000,01:30:00,01:26:00,C9.6,1730,S18W35  ( 1730 ),35,http://www.lmsal.com/solarsoft/latest_events_archive/events_summary/2013/05/01/gev_20130501_0120/index.html,9.6e-06,36\n11 /home/jovyan/scratch_space/adithya_hn/Surya_ML_data_Training_with_intensity.csv\nShell cwd was reset to /home/jovyan/adi_wdir/surya_workshop/downstream_apps/sf_triggers",
